%% The main boundary: browser SPA <-> Express API.
%% PROTOCOL [verified in code]: REST/JSON over HTTP, all routes under /api/* (server/routes.ts).
%% Auth [verified]: express-session cookie + Passport-local; CSRF token middleware (addCsrfToken).
%% Session store [verified]: in-memory MemoryStore (NOT Postgres), see server/routes.ts.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser SPA<br/>(React, TanStack Query,<br/>secureApi + csrf util)
  participant E as Express app<br/>(server/index.ts)
  participant M as Middleware<br/>(session, CSRF, auth,<br/>logging, sentry)
  participant R as Feature router<br/>(/api/&lt;feature&gt;)
  participant S as storage.ts<br/>(JSON files in data/)
  participant AI as AI providers<br/>(OpenAI/Google/Ollama/LM Studio)

  B->>E: HTTPS request /api/... (cookie + CSRF token)
  E->>M: session + CSRF + auth checks
  M->>R: dispatch to feature router
  alt data read/write
    R->>S: IStorage call
    S-->>R: domain object (User/Post/ChatSession/...)
  else AI inference
    R->>AI: HTTP call (chat / translate / summarize / prompt)
    AI-->>R: completion
  end
  R-->>B: JSON response
  Note over B,E: Dev: Vite middleware serves SPA (server/vite.ts).<br/>Prod: serveStatic from dist/public.
  Note over B,AI: WebSocket (ws dep) usage UNVERIFIED — needs human.
